WEBVTT

00:00:13.183 --> 00:00:15.269
That thing killed my son.

00:00:15.477 --> 00:00:17.146
I want justice.

00:00:17.980 --> 00:00:22.026
I'll expose you
for who you are and what you've done.

00:00:29.366 --> 00:00:30.784
(YELPS)

00:00:32.786 --> 00:00:34.163
(GROANING)

00:00:37.708 --> 00:00:38.709
(CAMERAS CLICKING)

00:00:39.001 --> 00:00:40.169
(PEOPLE CLAMORING)

00:00:40.544 --> 00:00:42.046
(LAUGHS)

00:00:45.382 --> 00:00:47.301
Look! Take photos.

00:00:50.346 --> 00:00:52.389
(GROANING)

00:00:56.185 --> 00:00:58.062
(SOBBING)

00:00:59.521 --> 00:01:01.148
(GROANING)

00:01:15.120 --> 00:01:16.455
Credence...

00:01:18.082 --> 00:01:19.291
(GRUNTS)

00:01:45.609 --> 00:01:46.735
(PEOPLE SCREAMING)

00:01:51.740 --> 00:01:52.783
(ROARING)

00:01:55.744 --> 00:01:57.204
Credence, no!

00:02:02.835 --> 00:02:04.420
Don't do this.

00:02:05.337 --> 00:02:06.463
Please.

00:02:07.798 --> 00:02:09.341
NEWT: Keep talking, Tina.

00:02:10.968 --> 00:02:13.053
Keep talking to him. He'll listen to you.

00:02:13.554 --> 00:02:14.805
He's listening.

00:02:17.683 --> 00:02:19.893
I know what that woman did to you.

00:02:24.314 --> 00:02:26.483
I know that you've suffered.

00:02:28.819 --> 00:02:31.363
You need to stop this now.

00:02:33.323 --> 00:02:35.701
Newt and I will protect you.

00:02:38.287 --> 00:02:39.496
This man,

00:02:40.706 --> 00:02:41.957
he's using you.

00:02:42.291 --> 00:02:43.834
GRAVES: Don't listen to her, Credence.

00:02:44.835 --> 00:02:46.503
I want you to be free.

00:02:48.005 --> 00:02:49.006
It's all right.

00:02:50.674 --> 00:02:52.009
That's it.

00:02:57.222 --> 00:02:58.265
(ROARING)

00:03:00.100 --> 00:03:01.185
Shh!

00:03:01.935 --> 00:03:02.978
Don't!

00:03:03.145 --> 00:03:04.188
-You'll frighten him!
-GRAVES: Wands down!

00:03:05.481 --> 00:03:06.857
Anyone harms him, they answer to me.

00:03:07.274 --> 00:03:09.276
-Credence.
-Credence.

00:03:09.568 --> 00:03:10.694
(SHUSHING)

00:03:11.403 --> 00:03:12.404
TINA AND NEWT: No!

00:03:12.696 --> 00:03:13.864
GRAVES: No!

00:03:14.198 --> 00:03:15.699
(SCREAMING)

00:03:21.246 --> 00:03:22.247
(SIGHS)

00:03:48.398 --> 00:03:49.566
GRAVES: Credence. (PANTING)

00:03:50.943 --> 00:03:52.402
You fools.

00:03:54.404 --> 00:03:56.240
Do you realize what you've done?

00:03:56.949 --> 00:03:59.910
SERAPHINA: The Obscurial was killed
on my orders, Mr. Graves.

00:04:00.077 --> 00:04:01.411
GRAVES: Yes.

00:04:01.912 --> 00:04:04.164
And history will surely note that,
Madam President.

00:04:05.832 --> 00:04:07.417
What was done here tonight was not right.

00:04:07.584 --> 00:04:10.254
He was responsible
for the death of a No-Maj.

00:04:10.754 --> 00:04:12.381
He risked the exposure of our community.

00:04:12.548 --> 00:04:14.258
He has broken one of our most sacred laws.

00:04:14.424 --> 00:04:18.011
A law that has us scuttling
like rats in the gutter.

00:04:18.428 --> 00:04:20.430
A law that demands that
we conceal our true nature.

00:04:21.098 --> 00:04:23.934
A law that directs those
under its dominion to cower in fear,

00:04:24.101 --> 00:04:26.019
lest we risk discovery.

00:04:26.645 --> 00:04:27.646
(GRAVES SIGHS)

00:04:28.480 --> 00:04:30.607
I ask you, Madam President,

00:04:32.401 --> 00:04:33.902
I ask all of you...

00:04:36.113 --> 00:04:37.948
Who does this law protect?

00:04:40.242 --> 00:04:41.535
Us?

00:04:43.579 --> 00:04:44.955
Or them?

00:04:52.045 --> 00:04:54.089
I refuse to bow down any longer.

00:04:54.256 --> 00:04:55.340
SERAPHINA: Aurors,

00:04:56.174 --> 00:04:58.677
I'd like you to relieve Mr. Graves
of his wand

00:04:58.844 --> 00:05:00.220
and escort him back--

00:05:23.201 --> 00:05:24.328
(AURORS GROANING)

00:05:27.039 --> 00:05:29.166
(SQUAWKING)

00:05:30.709 --> 00:05:31.835
(GRUNTING)

00:05:34.004 --> 00:05:35.380
Accio! (PANTING)

00:05:36.298 --> 00:05:38.342
(BREATHING HEAVILY)

00:05:44.848 --> 00:05:46.058
Revelio.

00:05:51.229 --> 00:05:52.272
(EXHALES DEEPLY)

00:06:11.083 --> 00:06:13.710
Do you think you can hold me?

00:06:15.545 --> 00:06:18.715
We'll do our best, Mr. Grindelwald.

